{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/passiveauthstatus\/notsupported"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/PassiveAuthStatus\/notSupported"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"notSupported"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On iOS, this occurs because the system NFC stack always pre-selects the national AID1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applet before the SDK receives the tag. The card’s security policy blocks cross-applet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access to the ICAO applet from within an AID1 secure messaging session."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is a platform constraint, not an SDK error. Passive auth works normally on Android."}]}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"case","modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notSupported","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Case","externalID":"s:6EidKit17PassiveAuthStatusO12notSupportedyA2CmF","title":"PassiveAuthStatus.notSupported"},"abstract":[{"text":"Passive auth could not be performed because the card’s ICAO data group files (SOD\/DG2\/DG7)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are not accessible in the current session context.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/PassiveAuthStatus":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"